SUMMARY:How Deep Is Your Love plus Director Q&A @ WTW Wadebridge
DESCRIPTION:How Deep Is Your Love plus Director Q&A (1h 33min)\nRomance\, D
 rama\n\nChef Xia Mingjun of a fashionable restaurant and his wife Lin Mo h
 ave been married for seven years. The previous passion and romance has gro
 wn dull and dry. Lin Mo uses every trick she can think of to restore their
  marriage\, but Xia Mingjun ends up leaving the city without a word. A yea
 r later\, the reborn Xia Mingjun worked as a diving instructor on an unkno
 wn island. He meets a woman named Bai Jie\, and falls in love immediately.
  Suddenly Mingjun realizes\, all the methods Bai Jie used to approach him 
 were the tricks he used to pursue Lin Mo\; could this familiar yet strange
  woman Bai Jie be his wife?\n\nStarring: Duan Yihong\, Wan Qian\, Qi Xi\, 
 Yuan Hong\, Wu Yue\, Dai Xu\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge\nBoo
 k tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5702/how-deep-is-your-
 love-plus-director-qa\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.github.io/wtw-cine
 mas/films/how-deep-is-your-love-plus-director-q-a.html
