SUMMARY:La Fanciulla Del West - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season @ WTW Wad
 ebridge
DESCRIPTION:La Fanciulla Del West - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (2h 2
 0min)\n\nGiancarlo Del Monaco’s atmospheric production brings to colorful 
 life a 19th-century mining camp during the California Gold Rush. At the ce
 nter of the action is the good-hearted bar owner Minnie\, sung by Barbara 
 Daniels\, who takes a motherly interest in the miners. Plácido Domingo is 
 Dick Johnson\, also known as the bandit Ramerrez\, who falls in love with 
 Minnie. Sherrill Milnes sings Jack Rance\, the sheriff who is not only det
 ermined to capture Ramerrez but also wants Minnie for himself. Bloodshed\,
  a crooked poker game\, a snowstorm\, and a near lynching ensue before Min
 nie and her bandit-turned-lover can ride off to start a new life. Leonard 
 Slatkin conducts one of Puccini’s most colorful scores.\n\nStarring: Pláci
 do Domingo\, Barbara Daniels\, Sherrill Milnes\, Anthony Laciura\, Julien 
 Robbins\, Charles Anthony\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge\nBook 
 tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5559/la-fanciulla-del-we
 st-royal-ballet-opera-2627-season\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.github
